[
    {
        "content": "<p>I'd like to export <code>simp</code> and <code>grind</code> logs to introspect/filter them with custom methods, is there some way to export them? Or even better, get structured data (JSON?) from their execution?</p>",
        "id": 596198378,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1779203437
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>One way is to use <code>#guard_msgs in</code> and then use the code action to get the trace pasted into your file.</p>",
        "id": 597389217,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1779618182
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks! I was hoping there was some API to export the contents of the info view to another file automatically, but this is a good alternative.<br>\nEDIT: the following gives a general idea of how to do this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">printToTerminal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">termPath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">handle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Handle</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">termPath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Mode</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">write</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">handle</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">putStrLn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">message</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">handle</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">flush</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">show</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">someMonadicValue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getThe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Core</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">State</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r'</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">printToTerminal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">devicePath</span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
